+
+                          |A B C| |x|                               Ax+By+C   Dx+Ey+F
+            Matrix * pt = |D E F| |y| = |Ax+By+C Dx+Ey+F Gx+Hy+I| = ------- , -------
+                          |G H I| |1|                               Gx+Hy+I   Gx+Hy+I
+
