+
+                           |A B 0| |x|                            Ax+By     Dx+Ey
+            Matrix * src = |D E 0| |y| = |Ax+By Dx+Ey Gx+Hy+I| = ------- , -------
+                           |G H I| |1|                           Gx+Hy+I   Gx+Hy+I
+
